<title>SLOVENIA: SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT SLOVENIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT SLOVENIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnia beat Slovenia 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in their World Cup European group one qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Slovenia: Zlatko Zahovic 41, pen</p>
<p>Bosnia: Elvir Bolic 5, Meho Kodro 32</p>
